# Butler product rules

- Primary persona is Facility Manager (Overview / OpsGlance). Board is secondary for supervisors.
- Overview and Board share one filter state and one ticket fetch — do not fork.
- Treat location (`15/F`, `G/F`, plant rooms) as navigation (chips, badges, API filter), not plain text.
- Keep OpsGlance horizontally dense; avoid tall stacked marketing-style cards for triage.
- JSON editing stays in the side drawer; main canvas stays ops-focused.
- Do not add floor plans, auth, or SLA systems unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer existing patterns: `OpsGlance`, `LocationBadge`, `FiltersContext`, `@dnd-kit`.
- User-facing copy: ops product language only (no assessment/interview framing).
